type keyword
shape
in_record true
reader urword
tagged true
optional false
longname stranded_srb keyword
description keyword to specify that record corresponds to the sorbed stranded mass.

block options
name strandedsrbfile
type string
preserve_case true
shape
in_record true
reader urword
tagged false
optional false
longname file keyword
description name of the binary output file to write the sorbed stranded mass of each cell.  The file can be used to give STRANDED\_SORBED for a simulation that continues from this one.

