block options
name stranded_et
type keyword
shape
in_record true
reader urword
tagged true
optional false
longname stranded_et keyword
description keyword to specify that record corresponds to the solute that evapotranspiration has deposited in the drained part of each cell.

block options
name strandedetfile
type string
preserve_case true
shape
in_record true
reader urword
tagged false
optional false
longname file keyword
description name of the binary output file to write the solute that evapotranspiration has deposited in the drained part of each cell.  The file can be used to give STRANDED\_ET\_SOLUTE for a simulation that continues from this one.

